<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - July 1.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - July 1.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST  180 CST    MDO    GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   91/93     96/98     UNQ    163/165</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  94/96     98/101  173/175  183/185</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Bunker prices tracked cargo levels to end lower on Tuesday, traders said. A handful of aggressive majors were seen cutting offers to attract buyers. But demand was average with a major heard to have an enquiry of 10,000 tonnes for 380-cst. One trader said poor bunker demand has also weighed down cargo prices.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
